  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Goat?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/52/Goat.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025202216\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Goat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Goat</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 32 • 37 • 50</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 2,150 • 5,400 • 8,650</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Goat Milk</span><span title=\"Goat milk\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/goat-milk-2299\" title=\"Goat Milk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Milk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/45/Goat_Milk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025193509\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 8 h</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Goats</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> that produce <a href=\"/wiki/goat-milk-2299\" title=\"Goat Milk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goat milk</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 32. They are the fifth and most expensive type of farm animal unlocked in the game.\n</p><p>Gender: Male\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3AGoat.png\" title=\"Goat.png (319 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/52/Goat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025202216\" title=\"Goat.png (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Goat\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat.png (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Goat\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Goat</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Full.png\" title=\"Goat Full.png (300 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/53/Goat_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025202147\" title=\"Goat Full.png (300 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Goat Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Full.png (300 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Goat Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Goat Full</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Scared.png\" title=\"Goat Scared.png (232 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d6/Goat_Scared.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025202516\" title=\"Goat Scared.png (232 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Goat Scared\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Scared.png (232 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Goat Scared\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Goat Scared</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Fainting.png\" title=\"Goat Fainting.png (289 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b2/Goat_Fainting.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025202858\" title=\"Goat Fainting.png (289 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Goat Fainting\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Fainting.png (289 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Goat Fainting\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Goat Fainting</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Hungry.png\" title=\"Goat Hungry.png (236 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Goat_Hungry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025202141\" title=\"Goat Hungry.png (236 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Goat Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Hungry.png (236 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Goat Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Goat Hungry</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Summer.png\" title=\"Goat Summer.png (55 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/62/Goat_Summer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20151130171956\" title=\"Goat Summer.png (55 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Goat Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Summer.png (55 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Goat Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Goat Summer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGoat_Winter.png\" title=\"Goat Winter.png (470 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Goat_Winter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20260516225700\" title=\"Goat Winter.png (470 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Goat Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat Winter.png (470 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Goat Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Goat Winter</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Alternate appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Themes</a></i>\n</p><p>Goats wear themed clothes and accessories during summer, Halloween and winter.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9b/Goat_Yard.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111228\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A goat yard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A goat yard\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A goat yard</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Goats must be placed in <a href=\"/wiki/goat-yard-2723\" title=\"Goat Yard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goat yards</a> to be purchased. Yards cost 1,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each. They are unlocked at levels 32, 37 and 50. Each yard can house four goats.\n</p><p>At level 32 goats cost 2,150 coins each; at level 37 5,400 coins; at level 50 8,650 coins.\n</p><p>Goats and goat yards can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>.<span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3c/Milk_Bucket.png/revision/latest?cb=20260513194316\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Milk bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Milk bucket\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Milk bucket</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Goat milk can be collected from goats every 8 hours. Players can skip the wait by paying 10 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> per goat. Players must then give goats <a href=\"/wiki/goat-feed-2260\" title=\"Goat Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goat feed</a> to get another harvest.\n</p><p>Goat feed is made of:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/corn-2063\" title=\"Corn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Corn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carrot\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>It takes 40 minutes to make 3 units of <a href=\"/wiki/goat-feed-2260\" title=\"Goat Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goat feed</a>. You can easily collect all your milk and replenish your feed stock by the time the goats are ready to be milked again.</li>\n<li>Goat milk can quite easily be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a> but sells quickly. Selling it at maximum price is recommended.</li>\n<li>Feeding farm animals and harvesting goat milk are common tasks in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Easter egg</b></span></h3>\n<p>Tapping the goat yard or making a rock explode causes the goats to faint for a few seconds, then get back up and act normally. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fainting_goat\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Fainting goat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fainting Goats</a> (or \"Myotonic Goats\") exist in real life. This rare breed falls over with stiff legs for about 10 seconds when startled or excited.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713101647\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" rel=\"noopener n